QuestGuidance.Register("en",280,{
[8929]="70057EE1\n1\tDefeat worms (total: 10)\tEnter the Clutch-hollow and defeat the worms within.\n",
[8930]="70057EE3\n1\tComplete Mission: The Den of Worms\tEnter the Clutch-hollow and defeat the worms within. Speak to Hórin to travel to the the Clutch-hollow.\n2\tTalk to Hórin\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Hórin for your reward!\n",
[8931]="70072EA0\n1\tComplete Mission: The Flames of Resistance\tYour mission is to go to Onabóha and set the Ordâkhai tents and banners on fire. Talk to Têsegi when you are ready to travel.\n2\tTalk to Têsegi Jiret-menêsh\tYou have completed your mission of setting the tents and banners at Onabóha on fire. Return with the Temámir scout to report your success.\n",
[8932]="7005A829\n1\tComplete Mission: The Flooded Depths\tYour mission is to defeat ukhrâsh and plug leaks in Gundabad. Speak to Ausma to travel.\n2\tTalk to Ausma\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Ausma for your reward!\n",
[8933]="7005A82E\n1\tPlug leaks (total: 12)\030Defeat ukhrâsh (total: 12)\tYou should defeat ukhrâsh and plug leaks.\n2\tDefeat the ukhrash matron\tYou should defeat the ukhrash matron.\n",
[8934]="7005CACB\n1\tRedirect the water (total: 8)\030Collect gears (total: 12)\tYou should redirect the flow of the water and collect any gears that you find.\n2\tYou should return to the entrance of the dungeon\tYou should return to the entrance of the dungeon.\n",
[8935]="7005CACD\n1\tComplete Mission: The Flow of Water\tYour mission is to collect gears and redirect the flow water within the dwarf-made waterways of Shalakâm. Speak to Hórin to travel.\n2\tTalk to Hórin\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Hórin for your reward!\n",
[8936]="70058C75\n1\tComplete Mission: The Fluttering Fires\tYour mission is to remove the bats who have descended upon Zarkul-sulûn. Speak to Ausma to travel to Zarkul-sulûn.\n2\tTalk to Ausma\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Ausma for your reward!\n",
[8937]="70058C7C\n1\tBurn bushes to clear bats (total: 12)\030Pick up a torch to burn the bushes\tPick up a torch and burn bushes to clear bats.\n",
[8938]="7005A830\n1\tComplete Mission: The Foregone Trap\tYour mission is to explore a recently uncovered dwarf-vault in Gundabad. Speak to Hórin to travel.\n2\tTalk to Hórin\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Hórin for your reward!\n",
[8939]="7005A833\n1\tFind a way out of the dwarf-vault\tFind a way out of the dwarf-vault.\n2\tDefeat the Orcs!\t\n",
[8940]="70059290\n1\tTalk to Celeblír\tCeleblír waits for you to help him search for Bilbo.\n2\tTalk to Elrond outside the Last Homely House\tElrond is waiting to speak with you outside in Rivendell.\n3\tTalk to Arwen across the bridge to the north\030Talk to Elrohir outside the entrance to the Last Homely House\030Talk to Glorfindel to the south\tElrond suggested that you consult Arwen, Elladan, Elrohir, and Glorfindel about Bilbo's whereabouts.\n4\tTalk to Elrond outside the Last Homely House\tElrond has come to the front of the Last Homely House to hear if anyone has seen Bilbo Baggins today.\n",
[8941]="7005927F\n1\tTalk to Bilbo Baggins in the depths of Goblin-town\tYour rescue of Bilbo Baggins from Goblin-town will not be complete until you have returned him safely to the surface!\n2\tTalk to Bilbo in Goblin-town\tBilbo has asked to speak to you before dealing again with Bauglám Fork-tongue.\n3\tTalk to Bauglám Fork-tongue\tBauglám Fork-tongue seems strangely confident about facing you in single combat.\n4\tDefeat Bauglám Fork-tongue in single combat\tBauglám Fork-tongue seems especially pleased with himself.\n5\tDefeat Thukafak in single combat\tBauglám Fork-tongue has chosen the troll Thukafak to face you in single combat.\n6\tRemain alert for further trouble\tYou defeated Bauglám Fork-tongue's champion. Will he now agree to the terms of the contest?\n",
[8942]="70059281\n1\tDescend the slope south-west of their camp-site to find the Elf-scouts\tNo one remains at the camp-site of the Elf-scouts in the high moor. Their duties have likely taken them down the slope to the south-west.\n2\tFind Ringhul down the slope to the north-west\tRinghul scouts down the slope to the north-west of Canaddal's position.\n3\tListen to Canaddal and Ringhul discuss the situation\tCanaddal and Ringhul have both returned to their camp-site and now discuss the troubling question of Bilbo's disappearance.\n",
[8943]="70059283\n1\tTalk to Arifael inside Giant Valley\tIf Bilbo strayed into Giant Valley, there may yet be a friendly face willing to help recover him.\n2\tHide in the dwelling just north of Arifael, and quickly!\tYou should conceal yourself behind the hide-covered dwelling just north of Arifael, and quickly!\n3\tRemain in hiding and listen to the conversation of the giants\tMendorn has arrived and is none-too-pleased to see Arifael. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n4\tTalk to Mendorn\tMendorn is prepared for combat. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n5\tTalk to Arifael\tArifael is satisfied that Bilbo never came here.\n",
[8944]="7005927E\n1\tTalk to Glóin at his camp in the Misty Mountains\tIf Bilbo wandered north instead of south, Glóin may have seen his old adventuring companion.\n2\tLook into the distance and learn of the disturbance\tWere those shouts in the distance? You and Glóin should look for the disturbance!\n3\tLearn what has caused the hasty return of Glóin's scouts\tScouts are returning to Glóin's camp with haste. What has happened?\n4\tTalk to Glóin and prepare for the onslaught\tGlóin needs your help to defend his camp.\n5\tTalk to Glóin\tGlóin is outside his camp in the Misty Mountains.\n",
[8945]="70059291\n1\tExamine the tracks in the snow to the north\tIf Bilbo did come this way, some of his tracks may have survived being covered by the recent snows.\n2\tDefeat the goblins and journey north in search of more tracks\tMore of Bilbo's tracks may lie to the north, hopefully not covered by the recent snows.\n3\tSearch the camp-site to the north-east for sign of Bilbo\tA small camp-fire to the north-east of the tracks may conceal some sign of Bilbo.\n4\tDefeat goblins and journey north in search of more tracks\tPerhaps Bilbo evaded the goblins at the camp-fire and journeyed further north. You should search for more tracks in the wide-open space at the top of the slope.\n5\tInvestigate the goblin-camp to the north-east\tA goblin-camp to the north-east lies directly in the path of the last tracks you found. What was Bilbo thinking?\n6\tTalk to the dying goblin in the camp of the slain\tA dying goblin lies among the slain. Did he see Bilbo?\n",
[8946]="7005928E\n1\tDefeat all the goblins and wargs in Pinnath Fenui before confronting their leader at the top of the camp\tYou should clear all the goblins and wargs from Pinnath Fenui to ensure none attack you from behind while you confront their leader at the top of the camp.\n2\tListen to Sorrog Crows-eye and learn what happened to Bilbo\tSorrog Crows-eye is not pleased.\n3\tYou have a choice: either to slay Sorrog Crows-eye or to spare his life. To spare him, ensure that you have him selected and then use the No emote. To slay him... you know what to do.\t\n4\tWait for Celeblír to arrive\tThings have gone from bad to worse: Bilbo is not held captive in Pinnath Fenui, but in Goblin-town!\n5\tCeleblír has arrived, and waits to hear what you learned about Bilbo's whereabouts.\t\n",
[8947]="7005928A\n1\tTalk to Celeblír\tCeleblír plans to cause a distraction that will let you access Goblin-town's main gate. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n2\tRemain hidden while Celeblír leads the goblins away\tCeleblír will distract the goblins, drawing them away from the entrance to Goblin-town. You must avoid detection by the goblins until he lures them away! This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n3\tThe goblins will surely have hidden a spare key to the gate somewhere outside Goblin-town.\t\n4\tUnlock the gate to Goblin-town\tWith the spare key in your possession, you can now unlock the gate to Goblin-town.\n5\tWait for Celeblír to arrive\tCeleblír has returned, and without his goblin-pursuers.\n",
[8948]="70059284\n1\tBy locking gates to other parts of Goblin-town, you can keep under control the number of goblins with which you must contend. Stay on the upper level! If you fall to the lower levels you will be swiftly defeated. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\t\n2\tTalk to the Guardian of the Jails\tThe Guardian of the Jails has arrived, and he is not pleased to see you. Stay on the upper level! If you fall to the lower levels you will be swiftly defeated. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n3\tWait for Celeblír to arrive\tNow that it is (relatively) safe, Celeblír has arrived.\n",
[8949]="70059282\n1\tFind Bilbo in the dungeons of Goblin-town\tBilbo must be held captive in the dungeons of Goblin-town.\n2\tListen to the discussion between Bilbo and his captor\tBilbo is held captive in a cell in the dungeons of Goblin-town.\n3\tDefeat Rukzot the Vicious and his minions\tRukzot and his minions stand between you and Bilbo's freedom!\n4\tUnlock the door to Bilbo's cell\tNow that you have the key to Bilbo's cell, you can free him from his captivity.\n5\tTalk to Bilbo in the dungeons of Goblin-town\tYou have freed Bilbo from his cell, but this is only the first step to the hobbit's freedom.\n",
[8950]="7006197D\n1\tTalk to Elladan\tYou should talk to Elladan to start searching the Ford of Bruinen together.\n2\tFollow Elladan\tYou should follow Elladan towards the Ford of Bruinen.\n3\tTalk to Elladan\tAt the ford, you discovered the corpses of three horses that belonged to the Black Riders. You should discuss these findings with Elladan.\n4\tFind Elrohir\tYou have made your way towards the Blooming Fens. Elrohir must be here somewhere.\n5\tDefend Elrohir\tYou have found Elrohir, though he seems to be in a bit of trouble. You should help defend him.\n6\tTalk to Elrohir\tYou have helped Elrohir successfully fend off a swarm of insects. You should talk to him.\n7\tExamine the black cloak\tThere seems to be a black cloak floating near the horses. You should examine it.\n8\tListen to the twins' conversation\tElladan has caught up with you and Elrohir. You should let the twins discuss their findings, or lack thereof.\n",
[8951]="70061986\n1\tTalk to Elrohir\tYou should talk to Elrohir.\n2\tFollow Elrohir\tSomething's not right. You should check the surrounding area with Elrohir.\n3\tExamine the large footprints\tYou and Elrohir have found a dead boar next to a set of large footprints. You should examine the footprints.\n4\tTalk to Elrohir\tYou should talk to Elrohir to see what he's discovered.\n5\tFollow Elrohir\tWhatever creature created these footprints may be dangerous. You should follow Elrohir and help him track it down.\n6\tDefeat the drakes\tYou and Elrohir have tracked down the drake matron. Defeating it would make the area safer for travellers passing through Eregion.\n7\tTalk to Elrohir\tThe drake matron has been defeated. You should talk to Elrohir.\n8\tTalk to Gwaihir\tYou and Elrohir have returned to Pembar to find Elladan waiting with the Great Eagle Gwaihir. You should talk to Gwaihir.\n9\tListen to the twins' discussion\tYou should listen to the twins' discussion about Gwaihir's report.\n",
[8952]="70061981\n1\tTalk to Elladan\tYour party has paused to take a break from the snow, but it's time to move on. Elladan has something to say to you.\n2\tFollow the twins\tYou should follow the twins through the pass.\n3\tDefeat the frost grims\tFrost grims have separated Elrohir from you and Elladan. You should defeat the frost grims.\n4\tTalk to Elladan\tElrohir has disappeared into the blizzard. You should talk to Elladan.\n5\tFollow Elladan\tYou should follow Elladan and help him find Elrohir.\n6\tExamine the snow-beast corpse\030Examine the blood\tYou have found a snow-beast corpse and some blood. Did Elrohir pass through here? You should examine them.\n7\tTalk to Elladan\tIt's possible that Elrohir passed through here, but you still have not found him. You should talk to Elladan.\n8\tFollow Elladan\tYou should continue following Elladan and help him find Elrohir.\n9\tListen to the twins' conversation\tYou have found Elrohir! You should let the twins talk.\n",
[8953]="7006197F\n1\tTalk to Elrohir\tYou should talk to Elrohir.\n2\tFind the source of the growling\tElrohir has noticed growling coming from somewhere down the road. You should find the source.\n3\tDefeat the wolves\tYou have discovered wolves surrounding a bear cub. You should defeat the wolves.\n4\tTalk to Elladan\tYou should talk to Elladan.\n5\tFollow the bear cub\tThe bear cub must have gotten separated from its mother. You should follow the cub and help reunite it with its mother.\n6\tDefeat the Warg and the wolves\tYou have found the cub's mother surrounded by wolves and a Warg. You should help the bear and defeat them.\n7\tTalk to Elrohir\tElrohir wishes to explain the situation to you. You should talk to him.\n",
[8954]="70061982\n1\tTalk to the injured sentinel\tYou have found an injured Galadhrim sentinel at the base of Talan Revail. You should talk to him to discover what happened.\n2\tFind and help the scouts\tTwo Galadhrim scouts followed the Wargs to the south-east but haven't reported back. You should find and help them.\n3\tFind the Warg pack-leader\tThe second scout warned you that the Wargs' leader stalks Cerin Brethil. You should find the remaining Wargs and their leader.\n4\tConfront the Warg pack-leader\tYou have found the remaining Wargs and their leader. You should confront them.\n5\tDefeat the Wargs\tYou should defeat the remaining Wargs and their leader.\n6\tTalk to Elladan\tThe Wargs have been defeated. It seems they do not serve Sauron, but rather, a Warg called Ránulur. You should talk to Elladan about what transpired.\n7\tTalk to Elrohir\tYou have finally arrived at Caras Galadhon. The twins are waiting for you in Galadriel's Garden. You should talk to Elrohir.\n8\tWalk with the twins\tThe twins will leave to meet with Lady Galadriel soon, but they have asked you to walk with them into the garden.\n9\tTalk to Celeborn\tThe twins have departed to complete their errand. Lord Celeborn would like to speak with you.\n10\tTalk to Galadriel\tThe twins have returned with Lady Galadriel, who seems to have a few words for you.\n",
[8955]="70057F89\n1\tComplete Mission: The Gate Captain\tYour mission is to find and defeat Rauzhúl, the Orc captain defending Shathur-munzu. Speak to Hórin to travel to Shathur-munzu.\n2\tTalk to Hórin\tThe mission is complete. Speak to Hórin for your reward.\n",
[8956]="70057F8F\n1\tCollect explosive barrels (total: 2)\tCollect explosive barrels to destroy the barricade protecting Captain Rauzhúl.\n2\tPlant explosive barrels (total: 2)\tPlant the explosive barrels next to the barricade protecting Captain Rauzhúl.\n3\tDefeat Captain Rauzhúl\tDefeat Captain Rauzhúl. He can be found outside Shathur-munzu.\n",
[8957]="700580F8\n1\tBlock goblin doors (total: 10)\tBlock the doors leading to the many tunnels inside Goblin-town.\n",
[8958]="70058102\n1\tComplete Mission: The Goblin-town Gauntlet\tYour mission is to block the doors leading to the many tunnels inside Goblin-town. Speak to Ausma to travel to the Goblin-town.\n2\tTalk to Ausma\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Ausma for your reward!\n",
[8959]="700580EC\n1\tComplete Mission: The Goblins for Gorgar\tYour mission is to defeat Dufnazt, a goblin commander in Sundergrót. Speak to Hórin to travel to Sundergrót,\n2\tTalk to Hórin\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Hórin for your reward!\n",
[8960]="700580F9\n1\tDefeat Dufnazt\tDefeat Dufnazt, the goblin commander in Sundergrót.\n",
})
